{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『デスブログ』のDVD\n発売しました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画館で見れなかった\n映画館で見たけどもう一回見たい！\n中田推しだし一応"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな理由でもいいですが\nチェックよろしくお願いいたします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/07/03/1746473/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画と言えば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は昨日ママと\n『渇き。』観てきたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/07/03/1746473/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"監督の中島哲也さん、\n実は以前\nばいしくるのMVでお世話になってるんです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画いろいろ凄かった＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖かったけど\n俳優さん女優さんがたの\n迫力のある演技にドキドキした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今めっちゃいろいろ映画見たい気分。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/07/03/1746473/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいあるよ～！\n餃子、レタスチャーハン、小籠包、ゴマ団子\nとか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/07/03/1746473/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青カビって聞いて\nJINのやつだー！！ってなってたけど\n名前出てこなかった＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもよりたくさんのコメントが＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこ効果かな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/07/03/1746473/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"語彙読解力検定の時は\n苦手な国語だったこともあって\n2位とか3位とかで\nどうしても1位はとれなかったけど\n今回は理数系の教科があって良かったな～\nと思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/07/03/1746473/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ここにいる理由』の撮影のときの\nモニターをまりちゃが撮ってくれた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/07/03/1746473/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/07/03/1746473/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/07/03/1746473/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメラが回ってない瞬間(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}